  "entity_type": "person",
  "description": "Alan Walker’s Walkerworld Tour has attracted more than 500,000 fans across North America, Europe, South-East Asia, India and China, alongside major festival appearances at Coachella, Tomorrowland and Ultra. His latest album, ‘World of Walker, Season One: Rise of the Drones’, opened a new chapter in his ongoing musical narrative, followed by ‘FATE’ with Ava Max. Beyond the music, Walker brought the project into gaming with a custom Fortnite experience that was visited by more than 200,000 players. With his touring operation, new music and digital projects all expanding in tandem, Walker continues to build a formidable fan-driven ecosystem.",
